点；（2）低血压事件的判定阈值；（3）心电图异常的临床意义判定标准。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bafca0395251_c560ecbf6c32c1bb","section_number":"3.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:598a65532fe24c94dc949063","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:r10:7ac5d92b5b3b1ddc"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261009191325_1935cb4b","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"恢复本章节正文与当前项目来源的证据绑定后重新核对。","category":"mapping_failed","gap_id":"gap:evidence-binding","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bafca0395251_efcf6300429a7706"}],"heading":"探索性目的和探索性终点","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节正文的当前项目直接来源"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本次输出未能把正文绑定到有效证据；需补充或重新绑定支持本章节的当前项目直接来源。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bafca0395251_efcf6300429a7706","section_number":"3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:598a65532fe24c94dc949063","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:r10:7ac5d92b5b3b1ddc"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261009191325_1935cb4b","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:revision:10","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索研究","quote_sha256":"2f5022140d2275d33560ae4bdb963c9a887859c61977316b91cfd69524bb8143","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:r10:7ac5d92b5b3b1ddc","span_id":"es_study_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:revision:10","quote":"样本量策略：按主要终点NT-proBNP组间差异估算，每组约100例；考虑脱落率15%，总样本量约240例","quote_sha256":"99d6717c35b7bab335a23cf24fd02adede86975e22b263786bbcca605fcf9903","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:r10:7ac5d92b5b3b1ddc","span_id":"es_sample_size"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:revision:10","quote":"访视策略：筛选（V1）、基线（V2，第1天）、V3第2周、V4第4周、V5第8周、V6第12周（终点）与30天安全性随访","quote_sha256":"8c1d7ca018b8e46d9855ddbef7bd76b1aaf361c4c16d87cdef4a5ba0fb2cc13e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:r10:7ac5d92b5b3b1ddc","span_id":"es_visit_schedule"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:revision:10","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：-28至-1天；治疗期：第1天至第12周；随访期：治疗结束后30天安全性随访","quote_sha256":"6d2ffc7852b9e349b8539673d0c52951b04fc124307d79f1a27bc778fac1d5cc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:r10:7ac5d92b5b3b1ddc","span_id":"es_study_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:revision:10","quote":"剂量与给药方案：KZ-sGC1501薄膜衣片：2.5mg、5mg、10mg每日一次（口服）；第1天至第12周（每日一次，随餐）。依从：每日服药日记卡记录","quote_sha256":"f0249c88c0a073ef05ced49a07ae93d1ebbedcfb5c17ffd9e9b0edc741c6a5fc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:r10:7ac5d92b5b3b1ddc","span_id":"es_dose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:revision:10","quote":"安慰剂：安慰剂对照（双模拟）：安慰剂薄膜衣片口服每日一次，与KZ-sGC1501同步使用12周；受试者按随机分配至安慰剂组或不同剂量试验组。","quote_sha256":"bf881c740d3c7f95af3672c1ad882887cdc0e0dbf11e1814f7cd3cc915c90d72","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:r10:7ac5d92b5b3b1ddc","span_id":"es_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:revision:10","quote":"研究人群概述：中国成年慢性心力衰竭（LVEF≤40%，NYHA II-III级）患者，标准治疗基础上症状仍持续","quote_sha256":"ed44c04b1f88a889bf8d7264714350d5b0fde3fb141cea19aec4bdbe3fbde3fe","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_e97013fe074855a4e4ff:r10:7ac5d92b5b3b1ddc","span_id":"es_population"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_bafca0395251_9fd3cd56f36cf28f:full-draft:598a65532fe24c94dc949063","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bafca0395251_316b3868eee23775\n章节编号=4\n章节标题=研究设计\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"6fb39914a034e4999afe11e6891e4bf789e0f0320c3e6bf54eaf902cdec22249","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:598a65532fe24c94dc949063","span_id":"es_section_4"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_study_design","es_sample_size","es_visit_schedule","es_study_periods","es_dose","es_placebo","es_population","es_section_4"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":7},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认随机化比例是否为1:1:1:1及是否需分层","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_randomization_ratio","missing_source_classes":["随机化比例与分层因素"],"target":"4节随机化比例"},{"action":"确认各访视具体评估项目清单","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_visit_assessments","missing_source_classes":["各访视具体评估项目清单"],"target":"4节各访视评估项目"},{"action":"确认盲法维持措施与紧急揭盲流程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_blinding_procedure","missing_source_classes":["盲法维持与揭盲流程"],"target":"4节盲法维持"}],"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":["随机化比例与分层因素","各访视具体评估项目清单","盲法维持与揭盲流程"],"proposal_text":"本研究为随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索研究，在中国开展。研究人群为中国成年慢性心力衰竭（LVEF≤40%，NYHA II-III级）患者，在标准心衰治疗基础上症状仍持续。受试者按1:1:1:1比例随机分配至安慰剂组、KZ-sGC1501 2.5mg组、5mg组和10mg组，每组约100例；考虑15%脱落率，总样本量约240例。KZ-sGC1501为口服薄膜衣片，每日一次随餐服用；安慰剂为匹配薄膜衣片，每日一次口服，与试验药同步使用12周。治疗期为第1天至第12周。研究时期包括：筛选期（-28至-1天）、治疗期（第1天至第12周）和治疗结束后30天安全性随访期。访视安排为：筛选（V1）、基线（V2，第1天）、V3第2周、V4第4周、V5第8周、V6第12周（终点）及30天安全性随访。依从性通过每日服药日记卡记录。","rationale":"研究设计类型、随机化、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心、剂量水平、给药方案、疗程、访视时间点、研究时期、样本量和脱落率均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实（MW-II-41F51F53-DRAFT修订10）。随机化比例1:1:1:1由四组等分推断，来源未明确写出比例，需确认。各访视具体评估项目清单（实验室检查、心电图、生命体征等是否每次访视均实施）未在来源中逐访视列出，需医学经理确认。医学经理还需确认：（1）随机化方法（区组随机或分层随机）及分层因素；（2）盲法维持与紧急揭盲流程；（3）各访视具体评估项目。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bafca0395251_316b3868eee23775","section_number":"4","source_ids":["